{
  "id": "pypi-sdist-magicless-ustar-prefix",
  "title": "sdist members carry a ustar prefix without the ustar magic",
  "category": "archive-structure",
  "intent": "node-tar ignores the prefix field without the ustar magic and names both members setup.py, so the later benign body replaces the first; pip's CPython tarfile joins the prefix and extracts the first body as the sdist's setup.py. The reader discloses the shape and the replaced body instead of reviewing only the decoy",
